					<![CDATA[
						 <p>It's odd&#8230; I don't particularly like 616, but this log adds quite a bit to it. Just putting human words and emotions behind all those 'causes psychological distress' sentences can really help the feeling of an SCP. It still doesn't save 616 from showing its age, but it's interesting to read nonetheless.</p> 
				 	]]>
